XLUCK:
X
XLuck is used in many different features of hack. In particular, luck
Xis used in combat to determine whether the user and his opponent
hit, and Xhow much damage is done. Luck is also used when praying,
and in using Xwands of wishing.
X
XLuck begins at 0, and increases or decreases as the game goes on. The
Xhigher the user's luck, the luckier he is. The maximum luck is
usually 10 X(although this changes with the phases of the moon in
some versions). The Xminimum luck is -10.
X
XThe user should try to be aware of two basic ways of modifying his
luck. XThe first is that killing any tame creature (such as your
